hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1872","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apni biwi ko talaaq di jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein haaeza thi. To Umar bin Khattab ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein poochha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke wo us se rujoo karey. Phir use rakkhey yahan tak ke wo paak ho, phir haaez ho, phir paak ho. Phir agar chaahey to uskey baad rakkhey. Aur agar chaahey to chhuney se pehley talaaq dey. To wo iddat hai jiska Allah ne hukm diya hai ke uskey liye auraton ko talaaq di jaey. (Bukhari: 5252)"
"1873","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujh par aik talaaq shumaar ki gai. (Bukhari: 5253)"
"1874","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Jaun ki beti jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil ki gai aur Aap uskey qareeb huey to us ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panaah maangti hun. To Aap ne us se farmaya: Beshak tum ne azeem ki panaah li hai. Apne ghar walon se jaa milo. (Bukhari: 5254)"
"1875","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai ke wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas daakhil ki gai jabke uskey sath uski daaya thi jo uski parwarish karney wali thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap ko mujhey tohfey mein do. Us ne kaha: Aur kya malka apne aap ko aam aadmi ko tohfey mein deti hai? Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne apna haath jhukaaya taake us par apna haath rakkhein taake wo sukoon paaey. To us ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panaah maangti hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne panaah denay waley ki panaah li hai. Phir Aap hamaarey paas nikley. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Usaid! Use do kapdey pehnaao aur use uskey ghar walon se mila do. (Bukhari: 5257)"
"1876","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rifaa Qarazi ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Rifaa ne mujhey talaaq di aur meri talaaq pakki kar di. Aur beshak main ne uskey baad Abdur Rahman bin Zubair Qarazi se nikaah kya hai. Jabke uskey paas kapdey key kinarey jaisa hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayed tum Rifaa ki taraf wapas aana chaahti ho? Nahi, yahan tak ke wo tumhaara maza chakhey aur tum uska maza chakho. (Bukhari: 5260)"
"1877","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) shehed aur meetha pasand kartey they. Jabke Aap jab Asr se wapas aatey to apni biwiyon key paas daakhil hotey aur un mein se kisi key qareeb jaatey. To Aap Hafsa bint Umar key paas daakhil huey aur jitna thehartey they us se zyada thehrey. To main ne ghairat ki aur uskey baarey mein poochha. To mujh se kaha gaya: Unki qaum ki aurat ne unhey shehed ka bartan tohfey mein diya tha. To unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us mein se ghoont pilaaya. To main ne kaha: Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam ham uskey liye chaal chalengey. To main ne Zam a ki beti Sauda se kaha: Beshak wo tumharey qareeb aaeyga. Phir jab wo tumharey qareeb aaey to kaho: Tum ne maghaafeer khaayen hain. To wo tum se kahega: Nahi. To us se kaho: Ye boo kaisi hai jo main tum se paaten hun? To wo tum se kahega: Mujhey Hafsa ne shehed ka ghoont pilaaya hai. To us se kaho: Uski makhi ne urfut choosa hai. Aur main wo kahungi. Aur tum ae Safiya wo kaho. Unhon-ne kaha: Sauda kehti hai: Allah ki qasam wo darwaazay par khada hone key siwa na tha. To main ne chaaha ke use wo suna dun jiska tum ne mujhey hukm diya tha, tum se dartey huey. Phir jab wo unkey qareeb aaya to Sauda ne us se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne maghaafeer khaayen hain? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To ye boo kaisi hai jo main tum se paaten hun? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey Hafsa ne shehed ka ghoont pilaaya hai. To us ne kaha: Uski makhi ne urfut choosa hai. Phir jab Aap meri taraf aey to main ne Aap se us jaisa kaha. Phir jab Aap Safiya ki taraf aey to us ne us se us jaisa kaha. Phir jab Aap Hafsa ki taraf aey to unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main tumhey us mein se na pilaaun? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey us mein haajat nahi hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Sauda kehti hai: Allah ki qasam ham ne use mehroom kar diya hai. Main ne us se kaha: Khaamosh ho! (Bukhari: 5268)"
"1878","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Saabit bin Qais ki biwi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Saabit bin Qais par main akhlaaq aur na deen mein aib nahi lagaaten. Lekin main Islam mein kufr ko naapasand karti hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum uska baagh use wapas karogin? Us ne kaha: Haan. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baagh qabool karo aur use aik talaaq dey do. (Bukhari: 5273)"
"1879","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Bareera ka shohar ghulaam tha jisey Mughees kaha jaata tha. Goya main use uskey peechey rota hua ghoomta dekh raha hun jabke uskey aansu uski daadhi par behtay hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abbas se farmaya: Ae Abbas! Kya tum Mughees ki Bareera se mohabbat par aur Bareera ki Mughees se nafrat par taajjub nahi kartey? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaash tum us se rujoo karo. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum mujhey hukm detey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main sifaarish karta hun. Us ne kaha: Mujhey us mein haajat nahi hai. (Bukhari: 5283)"
"1880","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ka kafeel Jannat mein aise hain. Aur Aap ne kalaama aur darmiyaani ungli se ishaara kya aur un donon key darmiyaan thoda faasla kya. (Bukhari: 5304)"
"1881","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey haan kaala ladka paida hua hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhaarey paas oont hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Unkey rang kya hain? Us ne kaha: Surkh. Aap ne farmaya: Kya un mein sabz hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To wo kahaan se hai? Us ne kaha: Shayed use nasab ne kheencha ho. Aap ne farmaya: To shayed tumhaarey is betey ko (nasab ne) kheencha ho. (Bukhari: 5305)"
"1882","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se liaan karney walon ki hadees mein riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne liaan karney walon se farmaya: Tum donon ka hisaab Allah par hai. Tum donon mein se aik jhootha hai. Tumhaarey liye us par raasta nahi hai. Us ne kaha: Mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhaarey liye maal nahi hai. Agar tum ne us par sach kaha hai to wo uskey badley hai jo tum ne uski sharmgaah se halaal kya. Aur agar tum ne us par jhoot kaha hai to wo tumhaarey liye door hai. (Bukhari: 5312). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Aslam mein se aurat thi jisey Subaia kaha jaata tha jo apne shohar key nikaah mein thi. Wo us se faut key sath faut hua jabke wo haamla thi. To Abu Sanaabil bin Baakak ne uska nikaah paighaam bheja. To us ne us se nikaah karney se inkaar kar diya. To us ne kaha: Allah ki qasam tumhaarey liye durust nahi hai ke tum us se nikaah karo yahan tak ke tum donon muddaton mein aakhri ki iddat guzaaro. To wo das raaton key qareeb thehri, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To Aap ne farmaya: Nikaah karo! (5318). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1883","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aurat ka shohar faut hua aur wo uski aankhon par daraey. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se surma key baarey mein ijazat maangi. To Aap ne farmaya: Surma na lagaao! Tum mein se koi apne burey kapdey ya apne burey ghar mein theharti thi. Phir jab saal hota to kutta guzarta aur wo leed phenkti. To chaar mahiney aur das guzarney tak nahi. (Bukhari: 5339). Nafaqaat ki kitaab."
